"""
This program is to be used by developers and 3rd party to create packages
that can be added to a junos-linux chassis running and evo stack.

We create a squashfs and a companion bom file.
Both can be signed with IMA or not. Both must be signed in order for IMA to be used.
Installation will add them to a new directory in /soft/current/addons

Unsigned addons will not mount in a IMA enabled run-time.

"""
